#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Discover daily newsroom topics (manual + cron friendly).

This script builds a fresh 10-topic shortlist from live internet sources rather
than replaying a static topic pool. It deliberately stops at the shortlist stage:
Steve chooses the topic before any draft is generated.
"""

